        "description": "One right-directed horizontal number line. Exactly four marked positions: -sqrt(7), 0, sqrt(5), 32/7, in that order. Each position has a short vertical tick and a label below the line. Only the origin is numerically labelled 0; there are no integer subdivisions, other named points, axes, or subfigures. Small isolated scan flecks are not mathematical points.",
